guide forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands
title Eastern Plaguelands, Winterspring & Tanaris
faction Horde
levels 56-58
zone Eastern Plaguelands
next forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus
# Built from the playthrough simulator's consensus route (Horde, visits
# 86-93) and machine-checked with lint; not play-tested on Forever yet.
#
# Optional: the Deadwood Cauldron chain (5084-5086) and Winterfall Ritual
# Totem (8471) start from rare Winterspring drops (forever/horde/50-60/03-
# winterspring), and Kernda speaks only to characters at Neutral with the
# Timbermaw.
#
# Flow: fly from the Undercity to Light's Hope Chapel (bind, Alen, Carlin)
# -> Lake Mereldar elementals -> Sword of Marduk -> the Pestilent Scar ->
# Undercroft (Hameya's scroll) -> Marris Stead (Nathanos) -> western hills ->
# Terrordale (Egan) -> Quel'Lithien Lodge -> Zul'Mashar -> Northdale ->
# Corin's Crossing (Living Rot) -> Nathanos -> Hameya's mound -> hearth to
# Light's Hope Chapel (Carlin) -> fly to Thunder Bluff (bind, cloth
# donations, Druid and Paladin training) -> fly to Bloodvenom Post (Trull,
# Deadwood Cauldron, Kernda) ->
# Timbermaw Hold to Moonglade (Rabine Saturna) -> Winterspring (Donova,
# Moontouched Owlbeasts) -> hearth to Thunder Bluff -> fly to Gadgetzan
# (Sprinkle, Egg-O-Matic, Linken's sword) -> fly to
# Camp Mojache (hippogryph eggs) -> Silithus.
#
# Super Sticky and Bungle in the Jungle (4504, 4496), which the export turns
# in at Gadgetzan here, are handed in by the Un'Goro guide at its own
# Gadgetzan stop.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Inside the Plaguelands the order is one loop: west, then north, then
#   back south. Villains of Darrowshire (5181) is handed to Carlin after the
#   hearth to the chapel instead of riding back east mid-loop, and To Kill
#   With Purpose (6022) is done at Corin's Crossing on the way back to
#   Nathanos (the export finishes it at once).
# - The Swamp of Sorrows stop (visit 91: The Swamp Talker, 2623) is dropped
#   with its Stonard bind: the later guides no longer do the Fallen Hero's
#   chain. Also dropped: Pawn Captures Queen (4507, an Un'Goro hive detour
#   the later route leaves out) and Poisoned Water's bracers (6804, accept
#   dropped in 03). The Gadgetzan bind is dropped (the hearth stays in
#   Thunder Bluff). The Cenarion Hold flight path and bind are in Silithus
#   and open the next guide.
# - Dropped: A Donation of Runecloth for Thunder Bluff (7823): the route
#   never hands it in.
#
# Left open for later guides: Heroes of Darrowshire (5168), Tirion's hunts
# (5542-5544), Wild Guardians (4741), Toxic Horrors (5086), A Reliquary of
# Purity and Wasteland (5527, 1124: Silithus), Linken's Sword (3914), Are We
# There, Yeti? (5163) and The Super Egg-O-Matic (2741, back in Tanaris).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Light's Hope Chapel

step Fly to Light's Hope Chapel
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip The Undercity's flight master is in the Trade Quarter's west tower, outside the walls.
  fly "Light's Hope Chapel"
  sethome "Light's Hope Chapel"

step Light's Hope Chapel
  accept 5281                         -- Caretaker Alen
  turnin 5210                         -- Carlin Redpath
  accept 5168
  accept 5181
  note Heroes of Darrowshire's items lie in the later Plaguelands zones: keep it.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The south

step Lake Mereldar
  tip Plaguehounds and their runts roam the shores of the lake south-west of the chapel.
  kill 8596 quest 5542.1
  kill 8597 quest 5542.2

step Sword of Marduk
  tip The shattered sword lies on the ground north-west of the lake.
  collect 12957 quest 5181.2

step The Pestilent Scar
  tip The skull sits in the Pestilent Scar, among Blighted Horrors and Plague Monstrosities.
  collect 12956 quest 5181.1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Marris Stead and the west

step Hameya's scroll
  tip A torn scroll lies at the entrance of the Undercroft, the crypt south of the Marris Stead.
  accept 6024

step Nathanos Blightcaller
  tip The Banshee Queen's champion holds the Marris Stead farmhouse.
  accept 6022
  accept 6042
  accept 6133

step The western hills
  tip Plaguehound Runts and Plaguebats roam the hills north of the Marris Stead, Carrion Grubs crawl among them; work north toward Terrordale.
  kill 8596 quest 5542.1
  kill 8600 quest 5543.1
  collect 13853 quest 5544.1

step Egan
  tip Egan the ghost stands by a hut in Terrordale, in the north-west corner.
  turnin 5281

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The north

step Quel'Lithien Lodge
  tip The high elf Rangers, Pathstriders and Woodsmen guard the lodge by Northpass Tower; the Registry lies inside. Rangers reach 60: pull one at a time. Noxious Plaguebats fly over the fields on the way.
  collect 15847 quest 6133.4
  kill 8564 quest 6133.2
  kill 8565 quest 6133.1
  kill 8563 quest 6133.3
  kill 8601 quest 6042.1

step Infiltrator Hameya
  tip Hameya hides among the Mossflayer trolls of Zul'Mashar, in the north-east corner.
  collect 15767 quest 6024

step Northdale
  tip Frenzied Plaguehounds and Monstrous Plaguebats share the fields around Northdale and Eastwall Tower, south of Zul'Mashar.
  kill 8598 quest 5542.3
  kill 8602 quest 6042.2
  kill 8601 quest 6042.1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Corin's Crossing and back west

step Corin's Crossing
  tip Living Rot spoils within ten minutes: kill the town's Scourge quickly and grind the seven pieces with the Mortar and Pestle at once.
  collect 15447 x7
  complete 6022

step Nathanos Blightcaller
  tip Ride west to the Marris Stead.
  turnin 6022
  turnin 6042
  turnin 6133

# Group quests (sim elites): Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee..., about 14 min saved for a party
step Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee...
  when group 6135
  accept 6135

step Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee...
  when group 6135
  tip Duskwing is elite: grouping up is advised.
  collect 15850 quest 6135.1

step Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee...
  when group 6135
  turnin 6135

# Group quests (sim elites): The Corpulent One, about 13 min saved for a party
step The Corpulent One
  when group 6136
  accept 6136

step The Corpulent One
  when group 6136
  tip Borelgore is elite: grouping up is advised.
  kill 11896 quest 6136.1

step The Corpulent One
  when group 6136
  turnin 6136

step Hameya's mound
  tip The Mound of Dirt is just behind the Undercroft.
  turnin 6024

step Carlin Redpath
  hearth "Light's Hope Chapel"
  turnin 5181

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Thunder Bluff

step Fly to Thunder Bluff
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Fly to the Undercity, take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar and fly on to Thunder Bluff.
  fly "Thunder Bluff"
  sethome "Thunder Bluff"
  train class only Druid,Paladin      -- Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise; Alodan the Hopeful

step Rumstag Proudstrider
  tip On Hunter Rise. Have the Wool, Silk and Mageweave in your bags.
  turnin 7820
  turnin 7821
  turnin 7822

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Felwood and Moonglade

step Trull Failbane
  zone Felwood
  fly "Bloodvenom Post"
  turnin 4521
  accept 4741

step Deadwood Cauldron
  tip Only if you found a Winterfall Firewater flask in Winterspring: ride north up the road. The cauldron stands in Felpaw Village, just south-west of Timbermaw Hold; the Deadwood furbolgs there are hostile.
  turnin 5084 optional
  accept 5085 optional

step Kernda
  tip Only if a Winterfall Ritual Totem dropped for you: Kernda waits at the Felwood entrance of Timbermaw Hold, and speaks to you only at Neutral with the Timbermaw.
  turnin 8471 optional

step Rabine Saturna
  zone Moonglade
  tip Go through Timbermaw Hold and take the Moonglade branch of the tunnel. Rabine is in Nighthaven.
  accept 5527
  turnin 1123
  accept 1124
  note Both quests lead to Silithus: keep them.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Winterspring

step Donova Snowden
  zone Winterspring
  tip Back through the tunnel and take the Winterspring exit, then ride south to Frostfire Hot Springs.
  turnin 5085 optional
  accept 5086 optional
  turnin 3909
  accept 3912
  note Toxic Horrors are in Felwood, on a later trip: keep it if you have it.

step Moontouched Owlbeasts
  tip Ride east to Everlook and north out of it; the Moontouched Owlbeasts roam the hills of Frostsaber Rock's southern slopes. Pull them one at a time.
  kill 7453 quest 4741

step Back to Thunder Bluff
  hearth "Thunder Bluff"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tanaris

step Gadgetzan
  zone Tanaris
  fly "Gadgetzan"
  accept 2741                         -- The Egg-O-Matic machine

step Sprinkle
  tip Use Umi's Mechanical Yeti on Sprinkle, the goblin girl in Gadgetzan. Quixxil and Legacki are scared later in the route.
  kill 7583 quest 5163.2

step Gaeriyan
  tip Gaeriyan is a ghost at the graveyard just north of Gadgetzan; the Conspicuous Gravestone is south of it, outside the town wall.
  turnin 3912
  accept 3913
  turnin 3913                         -- A Conspicuous Gravestone
  accept 3914
  note Linken's Sword goes back to Linken in Un'Goro: keep it.

step Marvon Rivetseeker
  tip Marvon camps by the Lost Rigger Cove road, south of Gadgetzan.
  turnin 3444

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Feralas and on to Silithus

step Hippogryph eggs
  zone Feralas
  tip Fly to Camp Mojache. The hippogryph nests are in the south of Feralas; each holds an egg for the Egg-O-Matic.
  fly "Camp Mojache"
  collect 8564 quest 2741

step On to Silithus
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip Fly to Marshal's Refuge, then ride south-west through Un'Goro to the pass into Silithus. The next guide opens at Valor's Rest, where the pass comes out.
  fly "Marshal's Refuge"
